#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-v5nano-overview.rst:11
#: 2f42dd5185db4337b0180739924f2485
msgid ""
"The CUAV v5 Nano is an advanced STM32F765 autopilot designed and made by "
"CUAV. CUAV v5 Nano is intended for engineers and hobbyists who are looking "
"for the power of CUAV V5+ but are working with smaller drones."
msgstr ""
"CUAV v5 Nano 是由 CUAV 设计制造的基于 STM32F765 的先进飞控。CUAV v5 Nano 专为寻求 CUAV V5+ "
"性能但使用较小无人机的工程师和爱好者设计。"

