#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-v5nano-overview.rst:119
#: 9e7833ab0f0846b8bd347af05246d5f4
msgid ""
"The RC pin on the MAIN/AUX interface and the DSM/SBUS RC pin are tied "
"together, which by default is mappped to a timer input, and can be used for "
"all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which"
" require a true full UART connection. Bi-directional protocols which include"
" telemetry, such as CRSF/ELRS, SRXL2, and FPort, can also provide telemetry "
"if the correct parameters are set when using these protocols, if the TX "
"input of UART6 (SERIAL5) is also used."
msgstr ""
"MAIN/AUX 接口上的 RC 引脚和 DSM/SBUS RC 引脚共连在一起，默认映射到定时器输入，可用于 ArduPilot "
"支持的所有接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外，它们需要真正的完整 UART 连接。包含数传的双向协议（如 "
"CRSF/ELRS、SRXL2 和 FPort），如果同时使用了 UART6（SERIAL5）的 TX 输入，并设置了正确参数，也可提供数传功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-v5nano-overview.rst:121
#: 5555157569c54f5ca02e94ca286c01b9
msgid ""
"In order for SRXL2 and FPort to provide telemetry, "
":ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` should be set to \"23\", enabling "
"the UART6 TX function instead of the timer interrupt, and:"
msgstr ""
"为使 SRXL2 和 FPort 提供数传，:ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` 应设为 「23」，以启用"
" UART6 TX 功能而非定时器中断，并："

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-v5nano-overview.rst:123
#: 057672c88dce42c3b35e411b87120a54
msgid "FPort: :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` = 7"
msgstr "FPort：:ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` = 7"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-v5nano-overview.rst:124
#: 3935ed3260de48859fb71dd97ab4c5d2
msgid "SRXL2: :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` = 4"
msgstr "SRXL2：:ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-v5nano-overview.rst:127
#: a6f0a5596a5d432ca3e495bf19c29fa8
msgid ""
"CRSF requires a full UART connection, so should be connected to "
"TELEM1(USART2) or TELEM2(USART3). Set the appropriate SERIAL1 or SERIAL2 "
"options to 0."
msgstr ""
"CRSF 需要完整的 UART 连接，应连接到 TELEM1(USART2) 或 TELEM2(USART3)。将对应的 SERIAL1 或 "
"SERIAL2 选项设为 0。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-v5nano-overview.rst:130
#: 9ac6f69ae8004f27b3f5a21a5f0fb1f5
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 中任何 UART 也可用于 RC 系统连接，兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详见 :ref:`common-rc-systems`。"

